Package: simcity
Type: Package
Title: Parallel Simulations for Common Statistical Tasks
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = c("Joshua", "R"), family = "Loftus",
           email = "joftius@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2905-1632"))
Description: Simplifies generating simulated data for some common statistical
    tasks in order to test and compare methods. Simulations of sparse
    high-dimensional linear regression are built from replaceable data
    generation, model fitting, and post-processing steps, and are run in
    parallel with reproducible random number streams.
